  "question": {
    "text": "On passing a gas, '<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>', through Nessler's reagent, a brown precipitate is obtained. The gas '<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math> ' is"
  },
